<title>FRANCE: Paribas unit takes Philippine, Indonesian stakes.</title>
<headline>Paribas unit takes Philippine, Indonesian stakes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French financial holding Paribas said on Friday its Paribas Affaires Industrielles subsidiary had taken a minority stake in Cosmos Bottling Corp of the Philippines for around $7.0 million.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it had also taken seven percent in Indonesia's Dynaplast, a company specialising in plastics for packaging.</p>
</text>
